{
  "_comment": "crossing-guard standard detection library (shipped default, embedded via go:embed). This is the OBSERVABILITY layer: detectors emit deterministic tags; policy is configured on top. Override or extend via a user overlay (cg detectors init) \u2014 same id replaces, new id adds, \"disabled\":true removes. 'roles' scopes a detector to event channels: tool_call detectors are inert on chat text and vice-versa. See docs/design/detection-library.md.",
